  "description": "Enrich an existing paperswithcode paper with its official GitHub repository, project page, Hugging Face artifacts, existing-taxonomy task/method tags, and a recognizable thumbnail through `create-thumbnail`. Use whenever the user asks to enrich a paper, attach its code or project page, improve its tags, fill missing links, replace Gemini URL extraction, or complete an arXiv/external paper page. Finds authentic URLs from cheap authoritative evidence, preserves existing tags and HF normalization, rejects false-positive repos, and fixes thumbnails that are missing, generic, “Untitled resource,” stale, broken, wrongly versioned, squat, letterboxed, or otherwise unsuitable.",
